e point in the retained BC query: `atlas:physical:CAN-173:BRC` (St. Elias Mountains), `atlas:physical:CAN-177:BRC` (Yukon Southern Lakes), `atlas:physical:CAN-178:BRC` (Pelly Mountains), `atlas:physical:CAN-195:BRC` (Georgia-Puget Basin), `atlas:physical:CAN-201:BRC` (Bulkley Ranges), `atlas:physical:CAN-207:BRC` (Eastern Continental Ranges). See #485 `assessment.json` and `README.md`. Neither screen is a complete rural settlement inventory and no absence inference is justified.\n\nFor exactly these six units, consult authoritative current provincial, local-government, reserve/community and official geographic-name sources. Assess settlement locations, exact coverage dates, legal retention/licensing and whether any source-backed correction or explicit unresolved conclusion is warranted. Preserve the physical AAFC role and distinguish settlement presence from political ownership. Do not alter shared boundaries, geometry or live data.\n\n<!-- worldatlas-work:v1\n{\"max_prs\":1,\"depends_on\":[485],\"scope\":\"Settlement evidence follow-up for exactly six British Columbia physical IDs enumerated above and in #485 assessment\",\"mode\":\"geography\",\"owned_paths\":[\"data/regional-review/bc-physical-settlement-gaps-followup-2026/\"]}\n-->","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChengshuLi/WorldAtlas/issues/606/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChengshuLi/WorldAtlas/issues/606/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/foll